22. As such, while affirming the finding of liability and other conclusions of the Tribunal, this Court remands the matter to the learned Tribunal for the limited purpose of verifying and determining the actual annual income of the deceased by -- (i) taking into account the exhibited ITRs (Exhs. 6(1) and 6(2));
(ii) calling for clarification or certification from the concerned Income-Tax Department regarding the total income reflected therein; and (iii) permitting both sides to lead additional evidence, oral or documentary, including cross-examination, confined only to the issue of income.
